# Deployment history is lab runtime state, not source. Each real deployment
# writes a marker here, so committing it would fill the log with one file per
# deploy and make every rollback show a diff. The record Phoenix acts on lives
# in the running system; see chaos/lib/deploy_tracker.py for the override that
# points tests and the API at a shared root instead of this checkout's.
deployments/
.worktrees/